WEBVTT

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.160
<i>All we wanted was someone by our side.</i>

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:10.130
<i>We had power.</i>

00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:14.740
<i>We ceased to be alone.</i>

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.070
<i>That humble happiness eventually...</i>

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.110
<i>...turned into despair as we died.</i>

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:49.520
<i>And then, we were born again.</i>

00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.210
<i>Before long, we realized something.</i>

00:00:58.670 --> 00:01:02.700
<i>We were fated to pass down our memories</i>

00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:05.440
<i>and feelings to another "us,"</i>

00:01:05.440 --> 00:01:09.010
<i>and watch over this world forever.</i>

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:18.080
<i>Love, beauty, and virtue
most certainly existed in this world,</i>

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:24.160
<i>but so too did even more 
hatred, ugliness, and folly.</i>

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:27.690
<i>Each time we were born into this world,
it took a greater hold of us.</i>

00:01:27.690 --> 00:01:33.460
<i>And that impurity gradually
gnawed away at our hearts.</i>

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:34.860
<i>Then,</i>

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.950
<i>a great many years later,</i>

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:43.370
<i>our modest desire transformed into
disgust and despair at mankind's nature.</i>

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.100
<i>Does humanity...</i>

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.860
<i>Does life...</i>

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:52.380
<i>...really deserve to be a part of the future?</i>

00:01:59.150 --> 00:02:01.140
Wh-What was that?

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:05.300
Shimako...

00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:06.800
Thank you.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:08.000
I'm all right.

00:02:09.690 --> 00:02:11.610
According to Sakuya's report,

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:15.110
Kotori's secret base should be
around here somewhere.

00:02:17.580 --> 00:02:19.110
I just heard a voice.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:20.430
Huh?!

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.860
K-Konohana-san?!

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:23.620
Wh-What are you doing here?!

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:29.230
That's a terrible wound!

00:02:29.770 --> 00:02:32.250
Hold on! I'll get you to
a hospital right away!

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:33.780
Over here?

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:34.610
Yeah.

00:02:34.610 --> 00:02:36.760
There was some strange 
feedback in the barrier.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.390
Kotarou!

00:02:40.390 --> 00:02:41.260
Kotori!

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:42.300
Huh?

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:19.590
I'd heard about it from Sakuya,

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.990
but there really <i>was</i> a place 
like this in the forest?

00:04:21.990 --> 00:04:24.260
Anyway, hurry up and come this way.

00:04:24.260 --> 00:04:25.570
Y-Yes!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:29.160
What are you doing?

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:32.310
I'm revitalizing the class rep's life force.

00:04:32.310 --> 00:04:35.330
It is similar to breathing life
into monsters.

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:39.840
So you really are a monster user?

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:41.030
Yeah.

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:42.970
A Druid one...

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.350
It looks like a violent battle occurred here.

00:04:49.790 --> 00:04:51.100
One used flames.

00:04:51.710 --> 00:04:52.980
As for the other...

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:54.700
I'm sorry.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:56.790
Could you take a deep breath for me?

00:04:56.790 --> 00:04:57.670
Sure!

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.340
So it <i>was</i> poison?

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.240
This entire area has been 
completely contaminated.

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:11.990
Don't treat me like a canary in a coal mine!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:18.290
Lucia!

00:05:17.440 --> 00:05:18.290
Konohana-san!

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:19.800
The bleeding...

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:22.020
The bleeding won't stop!

00:05:22.890 --> 00:05:25.920
Wouldn't her condition improve
if you used this?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:27.620
Just saying.

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:30.710
Kagari, this is no time for playing around—

00:05:30.710 --> 00:05:31.680
Wait.

00:05:34.740 --> 00:05:35.850
You're right.

00:05:36.350 --> 00:05:38.690
I will use it, Kagari.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:49.670
She still needs to get some rest,

00:05:50.140 --> 00:05:51.570
but she should be okay now.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:52.720
Really?!

00:05:53.770 --> 00:05:55.700
Th-Thank goodness!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:05:58.910
How do you like that?

00:05:58.910 --> 00:06:00.540
That's Kagari-chan for you!

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.880
I'm not called the Key for nothing.

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:03.940
Kagari!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.090
Huh?

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.340
My!

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:08.150
Thank you, Kagari.

00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:12.300
Thank you so much for saving Lucia.

00:06:16.920 --> 00:06:19.530
You're being awfully touchy-feely, Kotarou.

00:06:19.530 --> 00:06:20.250
Hey!

00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.160
Come on!

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:22.490
Not the face!

00:06:21.690 --> 00:06:23.360
What are they doing?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:26.380
I see.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.740
She's the Key?

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.110
Class Rep.

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:30.160
Lucia...

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.110
Konohana-san!

00:06:31.420 --> 00:06:35.050
I never thought I'd be able to
see her with my own eyes.

00:06:35.380 --> 00:06:38.070
Rumors need to be taken
 with a pinch of salt, huh?

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:40.090
Are you able to talk all right?

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:40.900
Yeah.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:43.170
I can't believe how much
the pain has subsided.

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:45.710
Is this also the power of the Key?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:48.080
I'd like to show my gratitude.

00:06:48.080 --> 00:06:49.510
Thank you, Kotarou.

00:06:51.150 --> 00:06:52.510
And you too, Kanbe-sa—

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.300
Thank you, Kotori.

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:56.430
Chihaya.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.440
You're welcome, Lucci!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:02.440
L-Lucci?!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:05.190
You were way too rash, Lucia!

00:07:05.540 --> 00:07:08.230
By the way, who are you?

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:09.450
Bit late for that!

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.500
Um, about that...

00:07:11.500 --> 00:07:16.880
You could most likely call me your enemy.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:17.750
An enemy?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.490
Yeah.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:19.780
I'm with Guardi—

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:20.690
She's a friend!

00:07:20.690 --> 00:07:21.330
Huh?

00:07:21.640 --> 00:07:22.460
Yes.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.460
She's a fellow member of the occult club,
and a friend of ours!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.340
Yeah, we're friends!

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:28.390
Huh?

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.300
Yeah, you're right.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:37.100
That's really all that mattered.

00:07:37.610 --> 00:07:38.510
Lucci?

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:40.520
What's the matter, Lucia?

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.660
Are you hungry or something?

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:44.800
I have returned.

00:07:45.810 --> 00:07:48.040
It looks like she's through the worst of it.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:48.720
Yeah.

00:07:48.720 --> 00:07:50.720
As long as she rests for a few days,

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.930
I believe she'll recover her former mobility.

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:53.930
Is that so?

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.890
In that case, I will reinforce the barrier

00:07:55.890 --> 00:07:57.660
and extend my scouting range.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:58.490
Please do.

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:01.740
I will also step up your intensive training.

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:03.870
As a way to relieve my stress.

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:04.620
Hey...

00:08:11.460 --> 00:08:12.640
Chihaya...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:16.640
I hope she was able to meet up 
with everyone successfully...

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.190
Shuuichiro, who do I look like to you?

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:27.150
Am I still myself?

00:08:27.150 --> 00:08:29.030
You are Sakura.

00:08:29.030 --> 00:08:30.920
You're still my Sakura.

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:35.120
That was Grandmother's...

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.870
Don't tell me this is the saint's...

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.230
It's me.

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.300
Tsukuno?

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.530
What happened?

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:49.480
Grandmother collapsed?!

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:53.580
Yes.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:55.030
I'll be right there.

00:08:58.780 --> 00:08:59.940
Shizuru-chan.

00:09:00.420 --> 00:09:01.450
Touka?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.030
I haven't seen Lucia-chan since last night.

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.690
Do you know where she is?

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:07.900
I-I don't.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.150
I see.

00:09:12.400 --> 00:09:13.860
I-Is that safe?

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:17.280
Don't living creatures melt
when they touch that?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:18.870
Inorganic objects are fine.

00:09:19.850 --> 00:09:20.790
What's wrong?

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:22.620
Was just my imagination.

00:09:26.030 --> 00:09:27.850
Lucci has stabilized,

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.500
so we have to bolster our 
forces while we still can.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:33.470
Is this how monsters are made?

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:34.190
Yeah.

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:37.020
By giving them a body and forming a contract,

00:09:37.020 --> 00:09:38.510
I can bring them to life and use them.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:43.290
Honestly, though, using an animal's corpse
would be most effective.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.550
A-A corpse?!

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:46.520
Done.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.650
Now just a little of this...

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.600
Oh, it moved for real!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:55.850
All right!

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:56.650
Oh?

00:09:57.140 --> 00:09:59.560
Did I mess up somehow?

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:15.420
Yo, Hothouse Princess.

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:18.560
Your friends are playing a fun game
of hide and seek in the forest.

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.330
Did they leave you out in the cold?

00:10:21.330 --> 00:10:23.440
It sounds like you've done your research.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:26.600
Those who know nothing die 
first on the battlefield.

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:30.470
I'm not like the foolish, peace-addled
humans in this country.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.610
I believe you're Fogo's master?

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.250
What're you planning to do with 
the Key by bringing the Strongest

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:42.620
and that stray superhuman 
together in the forest?

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:44.640
What are you after?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.900
They're my prey!

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.530
If you're going to meddle from the sidelines,

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:50.170
I don't care if you're Gaia.

00:10:50.170 --> 00:10:51.090
I'll kill you.

00:10:51.090 --> 00:10:52.630
That's all there is to it.

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:53.500
Keep that in mind!

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.710
Poison, huh?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.020
A powerful one at that.

00:10:59.020 --> 00:11:01.300
What about it?

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:05.810
What if I said I'd grant you a new power?

00:11:06.030 --> 00:11:07.110
Huh?

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:14.750
This is the legendary...

00:11:14.750 --> 00:11:15.380
Yes.

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.060
Save for the Strongest,

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:19.600
it's undoubtedly Gaia's greatest weapon,

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:20.640
the Earth Dragon.

00:11:20.640 --> 00:11:24.070
If you accept my condition, 
I'll give this to you.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.820
However, this monster will 
consume your life force

00:11:27.820 --> 00:11:29.830
more than any other.

00:11:30.110 --> 00:11:31.830
Don't underestimate me!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:34.640
Not just anyone could use Fogo, either.

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:38.110
So, what's the condition?

00:11:38.110 --> 00:11:40.160
That you don't kill the Key.

00:11:40.160 --> 00:11:43.870
Even if Guardian attacks, 
you must protect it.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:45.650
Damn, what a pain.

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:46.460
Got it?

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:47.990
If anything happens to the Key,

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:50.600
this damned world you detest 
so much will continue on.

00:11:53.060 --> 00:11:54.270
Fine.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.790
But aside from the Key,

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:58.610
everything is my prey, 
including your friends.

00:11:58.610 --> 00:11:59.890
You okay with that?

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:01.430
Do as you please.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:05.490
Life doesn't deserve a place in the future.

00:12:06.690 --> 00:12:08.910
I like you, Princess.

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:12.110
I'll destroy everything in my path!

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:31.240
Gil-chan tried to attack Kotarou-san
during his training and got crushed!

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:32.270
Good grief.

00:12:34.250 --> 00:12:37.240
The monsters do seem to be acting funny.

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.320
It only started recently.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:41.670
Do you have any idea why?

00:12:41.670 --> 00:12:43.400
According to Sakuya-san,

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:46.680
the soil in this area has been 
contaminated with poison.

00:12:46.680 --> 00:12:50.220
I think the power spot has 
been acting up because of it.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:52.210
Poison?

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:54.410
That most likely means it's my fault.

00:12:54.750 --> 00:12:56.150
What do you mean?

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:56.970
Well...

00:12:56.970 --> 00:12:58.930
Oh, you don't look well.

00:12:58.930 --> 00:13:02.060
Very well. I shall share my 
cherished feecof with you.

00:13:02.060 --> 00:13:03.850
Huh? N-No, I...

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:04.420
Gulp it.

00:13:04.640 --> 00:13:06.010
Come on, gulp it!

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:08.290
Hey, my body still isn't—

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.430
Lucia! Are you all right?

00:13:13.660 --> 00:13:15.680
Ow...

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.380
What a waste.

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:19.440
Lick, lick!

00:13:19.620 --> 00:13:21.860
D-Don't lick my face!

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:23.640
Hey! Stop it!

00:13:23.640 --> 00:13:24.440
It tickles!

00:13:23.850 --> 00:13:24.440
I know!

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.650
H-Hey, let me down!

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:30.530
But Lucia, you haven't regained 
your strength yet, have you?

00:13:30.860 --> 00:13:32.520
Isn't she heavy, Chi-chan?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.330
Th-That's rude, Kotori!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:35.680
It's all right.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:39.290
I'm strong due to the influence of 
the monster I've contracted with.

00:13:39.610 --> 00:13:41.290
The monster you've contracted with?

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:45.970
Oh, so that's how it is.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:50.100
This is total bliss!

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:50.900
Oh?

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.470
You aren't taking off your gloves?

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:54.910
No.

00:13:55.590 --> 00:13:57.010
That's right...

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.180
I started to mention this earlier,

00:13:59.180 --> 00:14:02.980
but I'm the source of the poison 
that polluted this forest.

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.200
Huh?

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.350
I'm sorry.

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:11.990
I was insensitive.

00:14:12.400 --> 00:14:14.580
You're saying even flowers are dirty?

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.430
It's water under the bridge now.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.500
Don't worry about it.

00:14:18.500 --> 00:14:20.620
No, I won't accept that!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.840
Ch-Chi-chan?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.000
Why do you have to suffer like that?!

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:28.100
I'm sure that deep down, you actually do
want to touch flowers and animals!

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.420
Save the world from destruction, 
no matter the cost.

00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:33.470
That is Guardian's mission.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:34.430
But...

00:14:34.430 --> 00:14:35.850
It feels so strange.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:39.410
A member of Gaia, who is 
trying to destroy humanity,

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:41.360
is worried about my well being.

00:14:41.360 --> 00:14:44.000
That's because I'm your friend!

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:44.860
Mhm!

00:14:45.960 --> 00:14:47.240
Right.

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.360
It doesn't make sense.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:52.870
H-Hey, you're totally exposed!

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:58.310
Gaia and Guardian say they're working
toward the same goal of saving the world,

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:02.250
but I can't imagine that's true 
based on what I've just heard.

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:04.000
You're right.

00:15:04.000 --> 00:15:06.620
That may not have been enough
of an explanation.

00:15:08.710 --> 00:15:09.420
Um...

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.890
That Sakuya really is merciless!

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.310
Better wash off the sweat right away...

00:15:15.890 --> 00:15:16.640
Huh?

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.190
K-Kotarou, you...

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:25.090
What are you thinking?!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.440
No debauchery! Let's keep it PG!

00:15:26.630 --> 00:15:28.150
I-I didn't do it on purpose!

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:30.510
I always come here to 
wash up after training—

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.320
K-Kagari?!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.830
Huh...?

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.590
Here you are.

00:15:54.310 --> 00:15:57.060
Canned feecof right after a bath
is the greatest.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:16:00.100
Yeah, I've been wondering about that, too.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:04.540
Why are Gaia and Guardian fighting 
when they have the same goal?

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:12.750
Although our goals are similar, 
the essence is different.

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:15.370
Hey, you're coughing up blood.
Don't push yourself!

00:16:15.740 --> 00:16:21.080
Gaia's goal is to eradicate humanity 
and regenerate this world.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:21.800
Huh?

00:16:21.800 --> 00:16:26.720
And Guardian's mission is to preserve 
the world that mankind has built.

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:27.420
Huh?

00:16:27.420 --> 00:16:31.510
It is correct that both wish to 
save the world in a broad sense.

00:16:31.790 --> 00:16:33.260
And Druids...

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:36.400
...exist to protect the Key until 
it hands down its judgment.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:39.700
As for what sort of Salvation 
the Key will bring about,

00:16:39.700 --> 00:16:42.100
we're honestly not too worried about it.

00:16:42.490 --> 00:16:45.110
They're all so extreme.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:47.110
Yummy.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.590
This question might be 
a little late as well...

00:16:48.810 --> 00:16:50.820
Whoa! What is this?

00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:53.860
What are Gaia and Guardian going 
to do with the Key, anyway?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:51.850
Awesome!

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.460
It's so pretty!

00:16:57.680 --> 00:16:59.800
To be blunt, we'll shelter her.

00:16:59.810 --> 00:17:00.580
Shelter her?

00:17:00.580 --> 00:17:01.490
Yes.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:04.920
We will keep the Key secure 
until we know what will happen

00:17:04.920 --> 00:17:07.380
in the Salvation she brings about.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.200
That goes for Gaia.

00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.490
For Gaia?

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:12.860
Then, what will Guardian do?

00:17:13.430 --> 00:17:14.580
We'll erase it.

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.010
Huh?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:19.510
As long as there is no guarantee this 
Salvation will benefit humanity,

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.240
we will erase the Key to 
maintain the status quo.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.390
That's Guardian's train of thought.

00:17:24.700 --> 00:17:27.020
You'll kill Kagari?

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:33.940
How terrible.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.030
Who would have thought there was 
such a reason to fight over me?

00:17:37.550 --> 00:17:40.480
I am indeed a temptress!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:41.340
Huh?

00:17:41.340 --> 00:17:43.040
It's tough being popular, isn't it?

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.100
Lucci?

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:53.420
Oh, I have no intention of
harming Kagari anymore.

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:58.600
I couldn't kill someone 
who has saved my life,

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:02.560
and who can talk to me, 
even for humanity's sake.

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.480
Thank goodness.

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.460
At the very least,

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:09.490
this means we won't end up 
fighting you anymore, right?

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:10.310
Mhm!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:12.510
I'm glad!

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:14.180
We're all like bees in a pod!

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:15.430
You mean peas...

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:17.110
I don't get it.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.910
If you are able to resolve your 
differences with conversation,

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.450
why do the majority of humans not do so?

00:18:23.970 --> 00:18:25.080
Well...

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.330
I studied many things.

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.530
Humans have continued to chip away

00:18:31.530 --> 00:18:33.910
at the planet's lifespan through 
destruction and strife.

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:37.340
Wasting energy like that is 
nothing short of pointless.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.020
Foolish humans should

00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:43.600
at least give a little more thought 
to how they use energy.

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:53.100
Even I can't eat any more...

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.180
Accelerating environmental destruction.

00:19:02.180 --> 00:19:03.960
Resources on the verge of exhaustion.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:07.360
And yet a segment of humanity continues 
to indulge in their pleasures

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:09.830
without any sense of impending danger.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.080
Just get rid of the humans.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.120
Foolish humans, huh?

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:29.270
Kagari.

00:19:29.950 --> 00:19:31.170
Oh, Kotarou?

00:19:31.170 --> 00:19:32.020
Is this a booty call?

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:33.490
No, it's not!

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:36.100
I just remembered someone 
who said something similar

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:37.290
to what you did.

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:38.580
Say...

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:42.030
Are humans really useless as 
far as the Earth is concerned?

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:43.390
Let me see.

00:19:43.390 --> 00:19:46.940
It is true that humans are 
foolish compared to me.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:49.270
I have learned that well by watching you.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:50.040
Hey.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:53.710
But humans do have their decent points.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:56.290
I also learned that well by watching you.

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.550
So, by putting those aspects to good use—

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.320
Kagari?

00:20:05.870 --> 00:20:08.430
Good... memories...

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:10.110
Good memories?

00:20:10.110 --> 00:20:10.890
What's that supposed—

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.220
Kagari?!

00:20:13.220 --> 00:20:14.170
What are you...

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:14.900
Huh?

00:20:15.210 --> 00:20:17.300
Good... memor—

00:20:17.990 --> 00:20:18.800
Kagari!

00:20:18.800 --> 00:20:19.780
Hey, Kagari!

00:20:23.200 --> 00:20:24.660
So it <i>was</i> a booty call.

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:28.910
No!

00:20:40.670 --> 00:20:43.720
Last Day of the Harvest Festa

00:20:43.720 --> 00:20:45.970
Gaia Japanese Branch

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.970
Sorry to keep ya!

00:20:56.000 --> 00:20:57.180
Let's go.

00:21:00.030 --> 00:21:03.280
Playtime is over, humans.

00:21:05.810 --> 00:21:07.020
No,

00:21:07.020 --> 00:21:09.700
I won't let you end it yet.

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.900
So rough!

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:14.170
Finding so much evidence

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:17.170
while patrolling the Harvest Festa
was seriously rough!

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:18.320
Imamiya-san!

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:21.210
We've lost contact with Charlie, 
who was scouting the forest!

00:21:21.400 --> 00:21:22.230
Huh?

00:21:22.230 --> 00:21:24.330
That's when you send Bravo to check on them—

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:26.340
We cannot get in touch with Bravo, either!

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.340
What did you say?!

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:32.850
Guardian Japanese Branch — Command Room

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:29.610
A short while ago,

00:21:29.610 --> 00:21:32.850
we lost contact with both the Bravo 
and Charlie scouting parties.

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:39.310
We must assume that a considerably 
powerful monster has been sent in.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.480
Doing that at this juncture must mean...

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:44.490
The Key is involved?

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:46.160
It is very likely.

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:49.940
Accordingly, I have decided to send 
in combat troops immediately.

00:21:49.940 --> 00:21:52.170
We lost contact with the scouting party...

00:21:52.810 --> 00:21:53.490
Here.

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:54.750
That place is...

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:19.120
<i>Do you hear it?</i>

00:22:19.870 --> 00:22:22.370
<i>If so, sing along...</i>

00:22:22.810 --> 00:22:25.210
<i>The song of destruction</i>

00:22:25.820 --> 00:22:27.730
<i>which will bring the world salvation!</i>

00:22:32.660 --> 00:22:39.080
Episode 11
"Countdown"
